  "post_title": "Onda Centre Comercial repite la campaña ‘OCC et puja a la Fira’",
  "post_date": "2017-09-29 22:21:48",
  "post_name": "onda-centre-comercial-repite-la-campana-%e2%80%98occ-et-puja-a-la-fira%e2%80%99-2",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/IMG_8902.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px;\">La Asociaci&oacute;n Onda Centre Comercial, en esta Fira 2017 (en la foto de arriba y en la galer&iacute;a de im&aacute;genes de abajo&nbsp;</span>40 fotos de la inauguraci&oacute;n de la feria de atracciones de la Fira del a&ntilde;o pasado)<span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px;\">, va a continuar reservando entradas para la feria de atracciones para su clientela al precio de 15 &euro; / 10 entradas. El &uacute;ltimo d&iacute;a para reservarlas ser&aacute; el mi&eacute;rcoles 11 de octubre.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/OCCetPujaAlaFira.png\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 674px;\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px;\">Onda Centre Comercial &nbsp;agradece muy especialmente la colaboraci&oacute;n de la Asociaci&oacute;n de Atracciones de Feria de Vila-real. Tambi&eacute;n dan las gracias al Ayuntamiento de Onda, la Conselleria de Econom&iacute;a Sostenible, Sectores Productivos, Comercio y Trabajo, y la Caja Rural Nuestra Se&ntilde;ora de la Esperanza por el apoyo recibido.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8898.jpg\" alt=\"img_8898\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8902.jpg\" alt=\"img_8902\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8903.jpg\" alt=\"img_8903\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8904.jpg\" alt=\"img_8904\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8905.jpg\" alt=\"img_8905\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8906.jpg\" alt=\"img_8906\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8907.jpg\" alt=\"img_8907\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8908.jpg\" alt=\"img_8908\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8911.jpg\" alt=\"img_8911\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8912.jpg\" alt=\"img_8912\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8913.jpg\" alt=\"img_8913\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8914.jpg\" alt=\"img_8914\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8915.jpg\" alt=\"img_8915\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8916.jpg\" alt=\"img_8916\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugfiraatraccionsfira16/img_8917.jpg\" alt=\"img_8917\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-